suus-php
PHP client for the SUUS Logistics (Rohlig Logistics) SOAP API

Copyright 2025 Very Code
Homepage: https://very-code.com
Repository: https://github.com/very-code-com/suus-php

This product is the first open-source PHP client for the SUUS/Rohlig Logistics
SOAP API, providing shipment creation, status tracking, document download, and
multi-country business-day scheduling.

